### Order service — health
GET http://localhost:8082/health
Accept: application/json

### Get cart (user-1)
GET http://localhost:8082/cart
X-User-Id: user-1
Accept: application/json

### Add to cart (user-1)
POST http://localhost:8082/cart/items
X-User-Id: user-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurant": "Restaurant A",
  "dish": "Pizza Margherita",
  "qty": 2
}

### Place order (user-1)
POST http://localhost:8082/orders
X-User-Id: user-1
Content-Type: text/plain

Library|2029-12-31 12:30

### Fetch order by id (replace {{id}})
GET http://localhost:8082/orders/{{id}}
X-User-Id: user-1
Accept: application/json

### Concurrency check — user-2 separate cart
POST http://localhost:8082/cart/items
X-User-Id: user-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurant": "Restaurant A",
  "dish": "Pizza Margherita",
  "qty": 1
}
